('23dcce',5.5,'Combinatorics',['Induction','Grid paths','Extremal arguments'],'The unique monotone path either isolates a smaller corner square or crosses the opposite diagonal and splits into two smaller square problems; induction gives n−1 obstructions and a nearly full antidiagonal attains it.'),
