('51a69a',6.5,'Geometry',['Orthocentre','Homothety','Arc midpoints'],'Two auxiliary perpendicularities make I the orthocentre of AEF; reflecting I across O gives the orthocentre of the arc-midpoint triangle. Parallel corresponding sides identify the concurrency point as their homothety centre.'),
